WEBVTT

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.940
Podvrgnuo se cingulatomiji,

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.981
i bila je nevjerovatno uspješna.

00:17:33.981 --> 00:17:35.474
Danas smo prijatelji.

00:17:35.474 --> 00:17:38.966
Ima divnu ženu i dvoje prelijepe djece.

00:17:38.966 --> 00:17:41.915
Pisao mi je za Božić poslije operacije,

00:17:41.915 --> 00:17:43.104
i napisao,

00:17:43.104 --> 00:17:45.511
"Otac mi je poslao dva poklona ove godine,

00:17:45.511 --> 00:17:48.113
Prvo, stalak za CD-ove iz The Sharper Image

00:17:48.113 --> 00:17:49.534
koji mi zapravo ne treba,

00:17:49.534 --> 00:17:51.631
ali znam da mi je to poklonio da proslavim

00:17:51.631 --> 00:17:53.359
činjenicu da mogu da živim samostalno

00:17:53.359 --> 00:17:55.406
i da imam posao koji izgleda da volim.

00:17:55.406 --> 00:17:56.967
A drugi poklon

00:17:56.967 --> 00:17:58.543
je bio slika moje bake,

00:17:58.543 --> 00:18:00.795
koja se ubila.